  <item>
    <title>134. 对话《一次聚会》剧组：爱情、亲情、友情都需要大吵一架</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69464e319f70e5d6b351d626</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69464e319f70e5d6b351d626</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Dec 2025 07:24:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“无论什么关系，争吵是必须有的。”日前，法式经典喜剧《一次聚会》中文版在上海话剧艺术中心迎来首演。该剧改编自法国同名口碑佳作，以一场因“取名”引发的家庭聚会为切口，幽默而尖锐地剖开亲情、期望与人际关系的层层面纱，成为年末最值得期待的舞台焦点之一。</span></p><span></span><p><img alt="32201910-6ZfQyHKFC61766120403268_1080x720.jpg" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxvYWQuYWptaWRlLmNvbS9pbWFnZS8zMjIwMTkxMC02WmZReUhLRkM2MTc2NjEyMDQwMzI2OF8xMDgweDcyMC5qcGc="></p><span></span><p><img alt="32201910-zEttRzkQ6h1766120414942_1080x720.jpg" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxvYWQuYWptaWRlLmNvbS9pbWFnZS8zMjIwMTkxMC16RXR0UnprUTZoMTc2NjEyMDQxNDk0Ml8xMDgweDcyMC5qcGc="></p><span></span><p><img alt="32201910-dDmKE3d8FK1766120423960_1080x720.jpg" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxvYWQuYWptaWRlLmNvbS9pbWFnZS8zMjIwMTkxMC1kRG1LRTNkOEZLMTc2NjEyMDQyMzk2MF8xMDgweDcyMC5qcGc="></p><span></span><p><img alt="32201910-HXTCrf5j2P1766120432784_1080x720.jpg" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxvYWQuYWptaWRlLmNvbS9pbWFnZS8zMjIwMTkxMC1IWFRDcmY1ajJQMTc2NjEyMDQzMjc4NF8xMDgweDcyMC5qcGc="></p><span></span><p><span>此前，我们专访了该剧主演陈姣莹、王衡、兰海蒙，与他们深入探讨：在笑声背后，那些爱情、友情、亲情中的人性考验。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-对话者-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>陈姣莹：一级演员，上海话剧艺术中心演员</span></p><span></span><p><span>王衡：一级演员，上海话剧艺术中心演员</span></p><span></span><p><span>兰海蒙：二级演员，上海话剧艺术中心演员</span></p><span></span><p><span>秦悦：长三角之声记者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-收听指南-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 角色介绍：热爱生活的家庭主妇、杠精教授和显眼包弟弟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="451">07:31</a> "这个戏最终要讲的是生活还要继续"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> “这样的争吵50次都不止”，吵不散的好朋友是怎么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 二刷、三刷会发现更多细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> 一句“好了好了好了”排了三四个小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> 假如要选一位剧中的人物作为您生活中的好朋友……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> 您可以接受好朋友隐瞒秘密吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2977">49:37</a> 怎么看待亲密关系中的争吵？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-互动方式-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@江南派FM</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信视频号/小红书：严老师殺时间 / 秦悦在此</span></p><span></span><p><span>社区：阿基米德 - 搜索《先锋派报告》</span></p>]]></description>
